      "created_at": "2015-07-20T20:15:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm currently reading \"A Rage for Revenge\" part of a great alien invasion series from the '80s. &nbsp;Every chapter ends with a wonderfully dirty and clever limmerick. &nbsp;For example:</p><blockquote><p>A short-organed fellow named Kevin</p><p>used a vacuum to stretch it to seven,</p><p>then to eight and to nine,</p><p>and though ten was divine,</p><p>there will be film at eleven.</p></blockquote><p>I'd enter every one of those in the contest if that weren't cheating. :)</p>",
